# BELLHOP: the crystal room (every X-5). Leaving the bubble starts it with
# one slow crystal ricocheting round the room; each time the room is
# cleared one more crystal comes and they all fly faster. Each is worth
# 200. Once a round goes on too long, the crystals vanish and the exit
# opens. The walls still wreck the ship. The demo pilot plays the rounds
# with real presses.
seed 2
game bellhop
wait 20
cheat stage 4
wait 30
expect round == 0
expect crystals == 0
expect exit_open == 0
press A
wait 2
expect round == 1
expect crystals == 1
expect cspeed <= 128
expect cspeed > 60
botuntil round == 2 2000
expect score == 200
expect crystals == 2
expect cspeed > 128
botuntil round == 3 2000
expect score == 600
expect crystals == 3
expect cspeed > 256
# the pilot now leaves them be: the round runs out
cheat bot_rounds 2
botuntil exit_open == 1 600
expect bonus_done == 1
expect crystals == 0
expect score == 600
botuntil stage == 5 1500
expect state == 4
# a wall is still a wall
cheat goto 4
wait 2
cheat place 20 100
hold LEFT 20
expect mode == 2
